---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Learning — GrabStack" description="What to learn, and in what order — courses, programmes and concepts mapped to the competency you need.">
  <section class="py-6 sm:py-10">
    <h1 class="font-sans text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
      Learning<span class="text-accent">.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-base text-muted">
      What to learn, and in what order — courses, programmes and concepts mapped to the competency you need.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="space-y-3">
    <a href="/learning/agent-taxonomy" class="group block rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-white/20">
      <h3 class="font-sans text-base font-semibold text-paper group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">A Taxonomy of AI Agents</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Seven axes that locate any AI agent — autonomy, initiative, loop, reach, scope, social and role. The cornerstone for understanding what agents actually are.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-muted">By Eric McLean · 2 June 2026</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/learning/leading-lagging-indicators" class="group block rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-white/20">
      <h3 class="font-sans text-base font-semibold text-paper group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">Leading and Lagging Indicators in AI</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Most people read the AI industry through the wrong instruments. The fix is knowing the difference — and weighting the leading one more heavily.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-muted">By Eric McLean · 3 June 2026</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/learning/ai-startup-data" class="group block rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-white/20">
      <h3 class="font-sans text-base font-semibold text-paper group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">What AI Is Doing to Startups: The Data So Far</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">The survival odds are roughly what they always were; the clock runs much faster, and the winners are far smaller.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-muted">By Eric McLean · 3 June 2026</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</Base>
